{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00728",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 3.88,
      "end_seconds": 14.07,
      "duration_seconds": 10.19,
      "text": "Mrs Haddad, come through. The doctor's ready for you, and your carer can come in too. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 17.92,
      "end_seconds": 25.23,
      "duration_seconds": 7.31,
      "text": "Thank you, nurse. Doctor, we've come about the night sweats. They're soaking her bedding."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.82,
      "end_seconds": 35.61,
      "duration_seconds": 5.79,
      "text": "It's not that bad. A couple of weeks, perhaps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 39.71,
      "end_seconds": 45.58,
      "duration_seconds": 5.87,
      "text": "It's a month at least, Mrs Haddad. I do your washing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 50.33,
      "end_seconds": 62.61,
      "duration_seconds": 12.28,
      "text": "So two weeks from you, a month from Mrs Haddad's side. I'll put it down as two weeks to a month. What are they like?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 67.38,
      "end_seconds": 77.67,
      "duration_seconds": 10.29,
      "text": "I wake up drenched. Nightdress wet through, and I have to change. Three or four times a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.31,
      "end_seconds": 84.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "Any fever with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.21,
      "end_seconds": 91.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "No fever. I'd have felt it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.88,
      "end_seconds": 99.96,
      "duration_seconds": 4.08,
      "text": "Have you lost weight, without trying?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 103.88,
      "end_seconds": 108.54,
      "duration_seconds": 4.66,
      "text": "No. If anything, I've put on a bit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 112.43,
      "end_seconds": 115.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "Any cough, or breathlessness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.19,
      "end_seconds": 120.84,
      "duration_seconds": 1.65,
      "text": "No cough."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.3,
      "end_seconds": 128.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "What medicines do you take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 132.54,
      "end_seconds": 139.81,
      "duration_seconds": 7.27,
      "text": "Just the omeprazole, 20 mg once a day, for her stomach. She has reflux."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.43,
      "end_seconds": 149.34,
      "duration_seconds": 4.91,
      "text": "And the room, is it warm at night? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 154.04,
      "end_seconds": 160.41,
      "duration_seconds": 6.37,
      "text": "I put the heating on low for her. She feels the cold. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.67,
      "end_seconds": 170.65,
      "duration_seconds": 5.98,
      "text": "How old are you, Mrs Haddad, if you don't mind? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 174.49,
      "end_seconds": 179.07,
      "duration_seconds": 4.58,
      "text": "Seventy-two. Why, is it my age? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.56,
      "end_seconds": 191.21,
      "duration_seconds": 7.65,
      "text": "Possibly part of it. I'm not going to guess, I'll do some simple tests first. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 195.9,
      "end_seconds": 198.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "What kind? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 201.81,
      "end_seconds": 211.9,
      "duration_seconds": 10.09,
      "text": "A blood test, to check your blood count, thyroid, and inflammation, to rule out any underlying cause."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 215.78,
      "end_seconds": 222.5,
      "duration_seconds": 6.72,
      "text": "I can do that for you before you leave, Mrs Haddad. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 226.19,
      "end_seconds": 227.75,
      "duration_seconds": 1.56,
      "text": "Fine. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.58,
      "end_seconds": 244.13,
      "duration_seconds": 12.55,
      "text": "Meanwhile, keep the bedroom cool, use cotton nightwear and a lighter duvet, and avoid hot drinks and spicy food in the evening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 248.98,
      "end_seconds": 253.04,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "I'll turn the heating off at night. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.08,
      "end_seconds": 267.14,
      "duration_seconds": 10.06,
      "text": "And keep a diary, how often it happens, and whether you also feel hot in the daytime."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 271.64,
      "end_seconds": 278.67,
      "duration_seconds": 7.03,
      "text": "A diary! Well, I can do that, if Aisha helps me. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 282.87,
      "end_seconds": 289.73,
      "duration_seconds": 6.86,
      "text": "I'd like to see you in two weeks, when the results are back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 293.99,
      "end_seconds": 298.08,
      "duration_seconds": 4.09,
      "text": "We'll be there. Thank you, doctor. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 302.92,
      "end_seconds": 306.02,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "This way, Mrs Haddad. ~"
    }
  ]
}
